    {
      "text": "The cover of 'Analysis and use of health facility data: Guidance for immunization programme managers', working document, February 2018: a blue panel with white line drawings of a vaccine vial and a syringe, and the WHO logo. In Fig. 2 it sits with the L1 Narrative guidance.",
